  "content": "<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">简介：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">这是一个模组库模组，包含 jtorleon-studios-team 模组的共享代码。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">支持的模组加载器：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">我们积极支持 Forge、NeoForge 和 Fabric 模组加载器，涵盖从 1.16.5 版本到 Minecraft 的最新版本。点击下方的链接以选择您想要的模组加载器：</p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/fabric-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/library-ferret-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 版本在此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[点击我🔗]</span></a></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/neoforge-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/library-ferret-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge 版本在此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[点击我🔗]</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">相关链接：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">查找我们的资源并加入社区：</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Link Tree </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252fdiscord.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Discord </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://github.com/jtorleon-studios-team\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Github </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">合作伙伴：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本项目由 BisectHosting 自豪地支持。访问他们的服务，即可轻松托管您的项目，享受高品质与可靠性保障。</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fjtl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/789de297-fbf1-423b-aa14-990433cf8f58.webp\" alt=\"banner bisechosting\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"> </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">立即行动：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">有疑问？需要帮助？加入我们的 Discord 或访问 GitHub，参与社区建设并做出贡献！</p>",
